   "text": "the blue block is the counter variable. In any given moment, it hold the count of the repeat between loop. Rename it to 'ledposition' (or any other descriptive name you come up with). and define the start and end values of the repeat between to 0 and 15, matching the LED strip's 16 leds",
   "title": "",
